Therefore, the current study included two levels of task loads (high and low) to investigate the effects of task load on performance and the interaction effects between task load and age. The high and low task loads were determined by a pilot study in which participants’ NASA Task Load Index (NASA-TLX) weighted scores were calculated after each of five task load conditions.

